     The ffwwggeett utility can be used to detect and install firmware packages for
     devices present on a running system.

     The options are as follows:

     --nn          Dry run, only show needed packages

     --vv          Be more verbose

     _s_u_b_s_y_s_t_e_m   Hardware subsystem, default pci

